# ===== Figures & tables — manuscript artefacts, MUST NOT be committed =====
# Figure and table artefacts belong to the manuscript and to Additional file 1;
# they are deliberately not distributed with this repository. figure_scripts_officialZ_20260917/
# writes its output into figures/ at run time, so this guard also keeps a re-run
# from re-introducing them.
figures/
tables/
figs/
*_caption.txt
*_legend.txt
*_Figure_Captions.txt
